Sample audio
------------
samples/multispeaker/nasa-podcast-ep434-2speakers.mp3 and the tutorial file derived from it are an
excerpt of "Artemis III Training", episode 434 of NASA Johnson Space Center's podcast
"Houston We Have a Podcast":
  https://www.nasa.gov/podcasts/houston-we-have-a-podcast/artemis-iii-training/
NASA-produced media is generally not subject to US copyright; see NASA's media usage guidelines:
  https://www.nasa.gov/nasa-brand-center/images-and-media/
The audio keeps its own terms and is not covered by the GPL. The transcripts in samples/ are
derived from it (NASA's own transcript is reproduced in the *.reference.md file).

